[center][size=6][b]Tachi[/b][/size]
[size=4]MCRN Corvette-class light frigate from [i]The Expanse[/i][/size]
[size=3]A legitimate salvage for Hardspace: Shipbreaker · v0.95[/size][/center]

[line]

The [i]Tachi[/i] is a full-size warship to cut apart, deck by deck. It is built as a tower, the way the ship flies in the show: engine at the bottom, flight deck at the top, and twelve walkable decks stacked between them.

It is about three times the size of the exterior ship on screen, to match the approximate size of the interior scenes.  Watch those doors and corners!


[size=5][b]What's aboard[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]12 decks.[/b] Engineering, weapons storage and control, galley, crew cabins, medbay, cargo holds, airlocks, command deck and flight deck.
[*][b]6 point defence cannons[/b], each with its ammunition belt and crates.
[*][b]2 torpedo tubes and 12 torpedoes.[/b]
[*][b]Fusion reactor and main drive.[/b] Eight plasma injectors feed the Solomon Epstein Drive.
[*][b]A full utility crawlspace[/b] carrying the power, coolant, fuel and ammunition runs between decks.
[*][b]33 crew bunks and 36 acceleration couches.[/b]
[*][b]Loose salvage.[/b] Bottles, snacks, data drives, suit pieces and supply pickups.
[/list]

[size=5][b]Numbers[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Length:[/b] 133.7 m
[*][b]Beam:[/b] 54.6 m
[*][b]Height:[/b] 46.3 m
[*][b]Parts:[/b] 5,311
[*][b]Cut points:[/b] 237
[*][b]Estimated mass:[/b] at least 268 t
[*][b]Download:[/b] 178 MB
[/list]

